<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20729" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hippŏcŏon</span></b> ,
		ontis, m.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Of Amyclœ</i>, <i>father of
				Enœsimus</i>, <i>who took part in the
				Calydonian hunt</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 8, 314</span></i> and 363; 
			<i><span class="en">Hyg.
				Fab. 173</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A companion of Æneas</i>, <i>an archer</i>, <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 5, 492</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hyg. Fab.
				273</span></i>.</div>
